{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>Of the sons of Joseph, of the sons of Ephraim</b> — and it does not say 'of the sons of Joseph, of Ephraim,' because Joseph did not bear a standard of his father's, out of honor for royalty; he did not wish to count him among the standards, and the standard was called by the name of his sons. Therefore it says 'of the sons of Ephraim,' in the same manner as it says for all of them:"], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:57.617649561Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}